{title: O Saiyyan}
{artist: Agnipath Roop Kumar Rathore Agnipath Ajay Atul}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C],        Meri adhoori kahaani
[Gm] [F] [C],        Lo daastaan bann gayi
[C],        Ho Tune chhuaa aaj aise
[Gm] [F] [C],        Main kya se kya ban gayi
[F],        Sehme huey sapne mere haule-haule
[A#] [F] [C],        angdaiyaan le rahe
[F],        Thehre huey lamhe mere nayi-nayi
[A#] [F] [C],        gehraiyaan le rahe
[C],        Zindagi ne pehni hai muskaan
[C],        Karne lagi hai
[F] [C],        itna karam kyun na jaane
[C],        Karvat lene lage hai armaan phir bhi
[F] [G#] [C],        hai Aankh num kyun naa jaane O Saiyyan...
[C],        Odhu teri kaaya Solah
[G#] [Fm] [C],        sigaar main saja loon
[C],        Sangam ki ye raina isme
[G#] [Fm] [C],        tyonhar main mana loon
[C] [A#],        Khushboo teri choo ke
[Fm] [C],        kastoori main ho jaaun
[C] [A#],        Kitni pheeki thi main
[Fm] [C],        sindoori main ho jaaun
[F],        Sur se zara behki huyi meri
[A#] [F] [C],        duniya thi badi be-suri
[F],        Sur mein tere dhalne lagi Bani re
[A#] [F] [C],        piya main bani baansuri
[C],        Zindagi ne pehni hai muskaan
[C],        Karne lagi hai
[F] [C],        itna karam kyun na jaane
[C],        Karvat lene lage hai armaan phir bhi
[F] [G#] [C],        hai Aankh num kyun naa jaane O Saiyyan...
